<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela CANTV to pay dividend June 30.</title>
<headline>Venezuela CANTV to pay dividend June 30.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan phone company CANTV will pay a 13.24 bolivar dividend on ordinary shares on June 30, the company announced in an advertisement in the local press on Sunday.</p>
<p>CANTV said it decided the date of the dividend payment in a board meeting on May 23 and would pay it in one installment to shareholders registered by June 16.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
